{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/48","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/48/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/48/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/48/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/48","id":5708663494,"node_id":"I_kwDOU7m4nM8AAAABVENKxg","number":48,"title":"终端上的键：键位表守卫 + 分层帮助","user":{"login":"Miaotofu01","id":196646782,"node_id":"U_kgDOC7iXfg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196646782?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01","html_url":"https://github.com/Miaotofu01","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":12540536715,"node_id":"LA_kwDOU7m4nM8AAAAC63lniw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/labels/ready-for-agent","name":"ready-for-agent","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Fully specified, ready for an AFK agent","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-05T08:14:03Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T08:18:00Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":1,"total_blocked_by":1,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Parent\n\n#30\n\n## What to build\n\n两件事，都是「键位只用终端一定收得到的那些」这条决定的守卫与收尾。\n\n**1. 键位表守卫。** 一条测试断言键位表里**不出现** `ctrl+enter` 这类不可靠的键——多数终端把它发成和 `enter` 同一个字节 `0x0D`，Textual 的 Keys 枚举里也没有它；同批不可靠的还有 `alt+enter`（在 8.2.8 上会塌缩成 `enter`）与 `shift+backspace`（在报告独立修饰符的终端上无效）。这条测试是**防回归的，不是防今天的**：往后再有人顺手加一个好听但收不到的键，会被它拦下。\n\n**2. 分层帮助。** 按 `?` 只显示**当前这一层**可用的键，不再是一张混杂了所有层的大表。\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] 一条测试断言键位表里不出现 `ctrl+enter`、`alt+enter`、`ctrl+shift+*`、`alt+方向键` 这类不可靠的键\n- [ ] 这条测试在有人新加一个不可靠的键时会失败（用一处故意的改动自检过）\n- [ ] `?` 在清单列表页只列这一层的键，在任务列表页只列那一层的键，在详细页同理\n- [ ] 帮助里列出的键与真实绑定一致（跟着绑定表走，不是手抄一份）\n- [ ] 关掉 kitty 协议推送之后，`?` 帮助里不再出现任何依赖它的键\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #34\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/48/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/48/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}